      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Patients undergoing a surgical procedure first must be properly anesthetized prior to the procedure to minimize discomfort. The effectiveness of a Computer Controlled Local Anesthetic Delivery System (CCLADS) known as the \"wand,\" was evaluated. Patient anxiety and pain associated with the injection of anesthesia both decreased using this method."},
